> The unihorn will not cure food poisoning will it?

Food poisoning is not the same thing as vomiting, but the unicorn horn
will cure both.  Food poisoning is caused by eating a rotted corpse.
Vomiting is caused by eating a rotten egg, bad tin, tripe ration, or
garlic (while undead).  (There are also a few ways you can vomit without
being in the "vomiting" state.)  Food poisoning will kill you; vomiting
will just cause you to vomit.

Interestingly, although food poisoning will not cause you to vomit, it
will cure your food poisoning if you cause yourself to vomit in some
other way.


